\wt{D}_\alpha(\rho\Vert \sigma):= \frac{1}{\alpha-1}\log_2 \operatorname{Tr}\left[\left(\sigma^{ (1-\alpha) / 2\alpha }\rho\sigma^{ (1-\alpha) / 2\alpha }\right)^\alpha \right] ,
